  "card_value_model": {
    "_how": "Estimated yearly value of a card for a monthly spend profile. For each category: points cards earn spend * earn[cat] / earn_per (default 100) points, valued at point_value; cashback cards earn spend * cashback_rates[cat] / 100. Monthly caps apply to the accelerated part (dining, online, groceries, travel; for fuel cards, fuel). Fuel cards also save the surcharge waiver (1% of fuel spend, capped). Yearly value = 12 * monthly rewards + lounge value - annual fee (the fee counts as 0 when 12 * total monthly spend reaches fee_waiver_spend). Lounge value: travel spend above ₹5,000 a month counts domestic visits used as min(visits, 8) * ₹1,000 and international as min(visits, 2) * ₹2,500 (unlimited counts as 8).",
    "categories": ["dining", "online", "groceries", "travel", "fuel", "utilities", "other"],
    "accelerated": ["dining", "online", "groceries", "travel"],
    "lounge_value": { "domestic": 1000, "international": 2500, "domestic_used_max": 8, "international_used_max": 2, "travel_spend_threshold": 5000 }
  },
  "emi": {
    "min_amount": 2500,
    "processing_fee_pct": 1.0,
    "processing_fee_min": 199,
    "tenures": [
      { "months": 3, "rate": 13.0 },
      { "months": 6, "rate": 14.0 },
      { "months": 9, "rate": 15.0 },
      { "months": 12, "rate": 15.0 },
      { "months": 18, "rate": 16.0 },
      { "months": 24, "rate": 16.0 }
    ],
    "_how": "Reducing-balance EMI: EMI = P * r * (1 + r)^n / ((1 + r)^n - 1), r = annual rate / 12 / 100. Total interest = EMI * n - P. Processing fee = max(processing_fee_min, P * processing_fee_pct / 100), plus 18% GST on the fee."
  },
