  "loan_math": {
    "_how": "EMI = P * r * (1 + r)^n / ((1 + r)^n - 1), r = annual rate / 12 / 100. Eligibility (home, personal, car): max EMI = monthly income * foir - existing EMIs; max loan = max EMI * ((1 + r)^n - 1) / (r * (1 + r)^n), rounded down to the nearest ₹10,000, capped at amount_max. Gold: max loan = grams * gold_rate_per_gram_22k * ltv_pct / 100, rounded down to the nearest ₹1,000."
  },
